OL,5,G0315 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FLarne to Dumfries: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo journeys from Northern
OL,8,     FIreland across the water to
OL,9,     FScotland. Leaving from the seaport
OL,10,     Fof Larne, he reaches Stranraer and
OL,11,     Fthe Mull of Galloway.
OL,12,G0340 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FGlasgow to Cumbrae: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo journeys from Glasgow to
OL,15,     FCumbrae, learning about a
OL,16,     Fforgotten Scottish expedition to
OL,17,     Fthe Antarctic.
